  "method": "big.spec.ts throttles the download through CDP (160 MiB/s), polls the demo progress record and reloads the page inside the 38-42 percent window, then counts the requests to /assets/big after the reload. The file records the bytes already written at the reload and the one request that followed (Range, If-Range, status, bytes sent). resumeLegWallMs (IndexedDB, run1 only) runs from the reload to the verified file. The OPFS resume leg was not timed. run1 is what the README quotes; run2 is the same-day re-run and carries no resumeLegWallMs.",
  "commands": [
    "node test/browser/range-server.mjs --port 8787 --serve demo/dist --test-endpoints --asset big=734003200",
